{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白色文字，字号最大、亮度最高，随后视线容易落到紧邻的第二块白字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"正在犹豫要不要回到过去的关系，担心回去也未必能找回曾经的亲近。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、期待、犹豫。\",\n  \"missed\": \"不愿再回到过去忍让的生活；想先把眼下日子过稳，同时害怕以后遇到困难只能独自承担，却不想因此收回当前的打算。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上下四块大号文字都具有较高的字号和亮度。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要拼起来才懂：想恢复亲近、不愿再忍让、先稳定当下、害怕未来独自承担。\",\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，快速扫视难以同时拿到处境和感受。\",\n    \"独立的文字块较多，视线从上往下移动时，需要不断切换信息重点。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8cb6916-65a9-4482-ac2f-602e954061cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T032256756618Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:23:23.296150+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4967a64c0643fd60423369156c0bf1a7cfa7602d64c126ad63cd163684db6ef6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422230